  "strategy": "Simple synchronous up/down counter",
  "description": "The design uses a single 8-bit register driven by the clock edge, with combinational logic to select increment or decrement based on enable and direction inputs. It saturates at 0 and 255 without wrapping, and resets asynchronously to zero. The architecture avoids extra pipeline stages or complex control logic.",
  "blocks": [
